<title>USA: TABLE - Playtex Products sells 144a notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Playtex Products sells 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a) debt issue from Playtex Products Inc was priced Monday via lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, according to a market source.</p>
<p>Playtex makes and distributes branded personal care products.</p>
<p>BORROWER PLAYTEX PRODUCTS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 8.875 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD  8.875 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P N/R	 SPREAD +267 BPS   CALLABLE  NON-CALL FOUR</p>
<p>NOTES: The notes have a three-year equity call for 35 percent at 108.875.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
